CLASS com/xk72/proxy/ssl/class_1387 com/xk72/proxy/ssl/ClientHello
	COMMENT what SSLHandshakeParser reads out of a handshake message of type 1. Charles 4's corpus
	COMMENT read the class the same way, and Charles 5 confirms it: SSLSnooper returns one of these
	COMMENT from the first record of a client stream, and every field lines up with a ClientHello
	COMMENT member. Was MaybeClientHello; the bootstrap match is confirmed.
